@@@!atrep-hom
@=litogramma=>at-tei

@@/ Litogramma's TEI export edge: nested to nested (the section
@@/ ladder maps onto typed divisions with nesting intact), and
@@/ almost everything else is a rename carrying the TEI element
@@/ identity as a vocabulary genos. Depth levels three and four
@@/ collapse onto subsection (lossy); free genoses (theorema
@@/ family) ride through the at-tei fallbacks. The reverse
@@/ direction awaits genos-dispatched morphism rules.

@@/ Front matter. The title opens the document: standing alone
@@/ (as canonical litogramma has it) it groups everything after
@@/ it into the text block and rides as that block's lemma, from
@@/ which the tei exo writes the header; a title inside running
@@/ text stays a phrase.
@># = _ .text
@:: = , .title
@:: =_ , .title
@:: =: , .persname
@:: =; , .persname
@:: =" _ .argument
@-- =#=

@@/ Structure.
@:: == # .part
@:: === # .chapter
@:: # # .section
@:: ## # .subsection
@:: ### # .subsection
@:: #### # .subsection
@:: #_ , .hi
@:: . , .num
@-- **

@@/ Inline.
@:: / , .emph
@:: * , .hi
@:: */ , .emph
@@/ The annotation span keeps its own genos (persname, date, ...)
@@/ so the tei exo can name the element; a bare span falls to seg.
@:: , ,
@:: $ , .formula
@:: $$ _ .formula

@@/ Lists and definitions.
@:: -- -- .bulleted
@:: .. -- .ordered
@:: .- -
@:: ::; -- .gloss
@:: :: -
@<< ;

@@/ Verse and drama.
@:: :~ ~
@:: := # .act
@:: :# # .scene
@:: :! , .name
@:: :!! :
@:: :[ _ .stage
@:: :- , .said
@:: :_ , .seg
@:: :. , .seg

@@/ Notes and asides.
@:: ^ ^ .foot
@:: ^^ ^ .end
@:: ^^^ ^ .end
@:: ^! ^ .editorial
@:: | ^ .margin

@@/ Quotations.
@:: " _ .quote
@:: "/ _ .epigraph
@:: "" , .q
@:: -/ , .date

@@/ Containers (free genoses ride the fallbacks).
@:: _ _ .floatingtext
@:: _= _ .theorema
@:: _- _ .propositio
@:: _: _ .lemma-block
@:: _/ _ .demonstratio

@@/ Apparatus.
@:: >> >
@:: >>> >
@:: >>>> >
@:: >[ >[
@:: >: , .name
@:: % , .term
@-- %%

@@/ The parsing pack (at-epimerismos) has no counterpart here: its
@@/ monosims drop; the token and sentence diaphanes pass through.
@-- !.
@-- !=
@-- !/
@-- !%
@-- !&
@-- !>
@-- !-
